<title>CHINA: China Jan-April cotton imports down 5.6 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-April cotton imports down 5.6 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 310,000 tonnes of cotton in the first four months of 1997, down by 5.6 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p> IMPORTS   JAN-APRIL	   APRIL	YR/YR CHANGE(PCT)</p>
<p> Cotton     310,000	   80,000	   - 5.6</p>
<p> EXPORTS   JAN-APRIL	   APRIL	YR/YR CHANGE(PCT)</p>
<p> Cotton	   11		 0	    - 98.7</p>
<p>Cotton exports in January and February were zero, compared with 470 tonnes in the first two months of last year, earlier figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
